# The build context for the mason image is this directory (deploy/compose.yaml builds from the repository root), so
# every ignored path here is bytes and layers a deployment does not need. `vendor/` is not ignored: the image is the
# repo, and `npm install` symlinks the @earendil-works packages out of it.
node_modules
# A package inside the repository (`integrations/`) installs its own dependencies; mason's image is not built from them.
integrations/*/node_modules
.dev
.data
dist
.git
**/.git
*.log
